translations.en:
A race of highly intelligent primates. These masters of science make use of Techs better than any other species.

  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore

^orange;Perks^reset;:
  Matter Manipulator: +^green;1^reset; Radius
  Health x^green;1.08^reset;, Energy x^green;1.06^reset;
  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;14^reset;% Cold, +^cyan;12^reset;% Electric, +^cyan;7^reset;% Cosmic, +^cyan;4^reset;% Physical
  ^cyan;Improved efficiency with all Techs^reset;
  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Jungle, Mud

^orange;Environment^reset;:
  ^green;Jungle, ^green;Primeval^reset;, ^green;Forest^reset;, ^green;Rainforest^reset;, ^green;Snow^reset; biomes: Defense x^green;1.15^reset;, Health x^green;1.1^reset;
  ^red;Deserts^reset;, ^red;Red Desert^reset; biomes: Defense x^red;0.85^reset;, Health x^red;0.85^reset;

^orange;Weapons^reset;:
  None

^red;Weaknesses^reset;:
  Max Food x^red;0.9^reset;
  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;12^reset;% Fire & Poison, -^red;5^reset;% Radioactive

translations.tr:
Son derece zeki primatlardan oluşan bir ırk. Bilim ustası Apexler, Tech'leri diğer tüm ırklardan daha verimli kullanır.

  ^orange;Beslenme^reset;: Hepçil

^orange;Avantajlar^reset;:
  Madde Manipülatörü: +^green;1^reset; Menzil
  Can x^green;1.08^reset;, Enerji x^green;1.06^reset;
  ^green;Direnç^reset;: +^cyan;14^reset;% Soğuk, +^cyan;12^reset;% Elektrik, +^cyan;7^reset;% Kozmik, +^cyan;4^reset;% Fiziksel
  ^cyan;Tüm Tech'lerde geliştirilmiş verim^reset;
  ^cyan;Bağışıklık^reset;: Tropik Orman, Çamur

^orange;Çevre^reset;:
  ^green;Tropik Orman, ^green;Kadim Orman^reset;, ^green;Orman^reset;, ^green;Yağmur Ormanı^reset;, ^green;Kar^reset; biyomları: Savunma x^green;1.15^reset;, Can x^green;1.1^reset;
  ^red;Çöller^reset;, ^red;Kızıl Çöl^reset; biyomları: Savunma x^red;0.85^reset;, Can x^red;0.85^reset;

^orange;Silahlar^reset;:
  Yok

^red;Zayıflıklar^reset;:
  Azami Doygunluk x^red;0.9^reset;
  ^red;Direnç^reset;: -^red;12^reset;% Ateş ve Zehir, -^red;5^reset;% Radyasyon

translations.en:
A people of powerful faith and strongly attuned to the universe, Avians are naturals with staves and wands and are exceptionally agile.

  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Omnivore

^orange;Perks^reset;:
  Damage x^green;1.05^reset;
  Energy x^green;1.15^reset;
  +^green;15^reset;% Jump Height, Fall Damage x^green;0.5^reset;
  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;25^reset;% Electric
  Tech: ^green;Avian Slowfall^reset;
  Immune: ^green;Electrified^reset;

^orange;Environment^reset;:
  When airborne: Damage x^green;1.12^reset;
  Low to moderate wind: Air mobility
  Low wind: Health x^green;1.15^reset;, Defense x^green;1.1^reset;
  ^red;Irradiated^reset;, ^red;Scorched^reset;, ^red;Tidewater^reset; biomes: x^red;0.8^reset; Defense
^orange;Weapons^reset;:
  Wand/Staff: Damage x^green;1.2^reset;, +^green;15^reset;% Resist in equipped element
  Wand + Dagger: Can fire Cosmic Blasts (^green;Energy/16^reset; dmg)
  Quarterstaff Mastery: +^green;25^reset;%

^red;Weaknesses^reset;:
  Health x^red;0.85^reset;,
  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;5^reset;% Physical, -^red;15^reset;% Fire, -^red;10^reset;% Radioactive

translations.tr:
Güçlü inançlara sahip ve evrenle kuvvetli bir bağ kuran Avianlar, asa ve değnek kullanımında doğuştan yetenekli ve son derece çeviktir.

  ^orange;Beslenme^reset;: Hepçil

^orange;Avantajlar^reset;:
  Hasar x^green;1.05^reset;
  Enerji x^green;1.15^reset;
  +^green;15^reset;% Zıplama Yüksekliği, Düşme Hasarı x^green;0.5^reset;
  ^green;Direnç^reset;: +^cyan;25^reset;% Elektrik
  Tech: ^green;Avian Yavaş Düşüş^reset;
  Bağışıklık: ^green;Elektriklenme^reset;

^orange;Çevre^reset;:
  Havadayken: Hasar x^green;1.12^reset;
  Hafif ve orta rüzgâr: Havada hareket kabiliyeti
  Hafif rüzgâr: Can x^green;1.15^reset;, Savunma x^green;1.1^reset;
  ^red;Radyasyonlu^reset;, ^red;Kavrulmuş^reset;, ^red;Gelgit Suları^reset; biyomları: Savunma x^red;0.8^reset;
^orange;Silahlar^reset;:
  Değnek/Asa: Hasar x^green;1.2^reset;, kuşanılan elemente +^green;15^reset;% Direnç
  Değnek + Hançer: Kozmik Patlamalar ateşleyebilir (^green;Enerji/16^reset; hasar)
  Dövüş Asası Ustalığı: +^green;25^reset;%

^red;Zayıflıklar^reset;:
  Can x^red;0.85^reset;,
  ^red;Direnç^reset;: -^red;5^reset;% Fiziksel, -^red;15^reset;% Ateş, -^red;10^reset;% Radyasyon

translations.en:
Fenerox are new to the established galactic order. Their tech is generally rather low, and only a few have moved beyond their hunter-gatherer lifestyle. Their skill in hunting is remarkable.

  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Carnivore

^orange;Perks^reset;:
  +^green;12^reset;% Speed & Jump, Damage x^green;1.05^reset;, +^green;5^reset;% Charisma
  ^green;Night Vision^reset;
  ^green;Regenerate at night if sufficiently fed.^reset;
  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;20^reset;% Electric, +^cyan;15^reset;% Cosmic, +^cyan;5^reset;% Poison, Shadow, +^cyan;2^reset;% Fire
  Tech: ^green;Hunter's Claw^reset;
  ^green;Immune^reset;: Electrified

^orange;Environment^reset;:
  ^green;Savannah^reset;: Damage x^green;1.15^reset;
  At night, if well fed, gain +^green;15^reset;% Physical Resist and +^green;2^reset; Defense
  ^red;Sulphuric,Slime and Tar biomes^reset;: Defense x^red;0.8^reset;

^orange;Weapons^reset;:
  Spear Mastery +^green;25^reset;%
  ^green;Add your current speed/4 as bonus melee damage.^reset;
  ^red;Attacking with spears costs Hunger^reset;

^red;Weaknesses^reset;:
  Health x^red;0.9^reset;
  ^red;Resist^reset;: -^red;18^reset;% Ice, -^red;15^reset;% Physical Resist

translations.tr:
Feneroxlar yerleşik galaktik düzene yeni katıldı. Teknolojileri genellikle oldukça ilkel ve yalnızca çok azı avcı-toplayıcı yaşam biçiminin ötesine geçti. Avcılıkta olağanüstü yetenekliler.

  ^orange;Beslenme^reset;: Etçil

^orange;Avantajlar^reset;:
  +^green;12^reset;% Hız ve Zıplama, Hasar x^green;1.05^reset;, +^green;5^reset;% Karizma
  ^green;Gece Görüşü^reset;
  ^green;Yeterince toksa geceleri can yeniler.^reset;
  ^green;Direnç^reset;: +^cyan;20^reset;% Elektrik, +^cyan;15^reset;% Kozmik, +^cyan;5^reset;% Zehir, Gölge, +^cyan;2^reset;% Ateş
  Tech: ^green;Avcı Pençeleri^reset;
  ^green;Bağışıklık^reset;: Elektriklenme

^orange;Çevre^reset;:
  ^green;Savan^reset;: Hasar x^green;1.15^reset;
  Geceleri iyi beslenmişse +^green;15^reset;% Fiziksel Direnç ve +^green;2^reset; Savunma kazanır
  ^red;Kükürtlü, Balçık ve Katran biyomları^reset;: Savunma x^red;0.8^reset;

^orange;Silahlar^reset;:
  Mızrak Ustalığı +^green;25^reset;%
  ^green;Mevcut hızının/4'ünü ilave yakın dövüş hasarı olarak ekler.^reset;
  ^red;Mızrakla saldırmak Açlık tüketir^reset;

^red;Zayıflıklar^reset;:
  Can x^red;0.9^reset;
  ^red;Direnç^reset;: -^red;18^reset;% Buz, -^red;15^reset;% Fiziksel Direnç

translations.en:
An unusual psionic species of extremophiles. Can generate a powerful psionic vibration through sheer willpower.

  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Any (including prepared Isotopes)

^orange;Perks^reset;:
  Energy x^green;1.1^reset;
  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;30^reset;% Mental, +^cyan;20^reset;% Fire & Electric, +^cyan;15^reset;% Cosmic & Radioactive
  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Burning
  Tech: ^green;Psionic Wave^reset;

^orange;Environment^reset;:
  ^green;Electrically charged or crystal^reset; biomes: +^green;5% speed^reset;
  ^red;Cold^reset; biomes: Defense x^red;0.9^reset;

^orange;Weapons^reset;:
  Precognition: +^cyan;8%^reset; to ^green;all^reset; damage
