  -^red;10^reset;% Karizma

translations.en:
A mystery to the cosmos, the illusive Shadow people prefer to speak only to each other. This is simple, as other species cannot even hear their language.

  ^orange;Diet^reset;: Any

^orange;Perks^reset;:
  Energy x^green;1.12^reset;, ^green;15%^reset; reduced Hunger drain
  ^green;Resist^reset;: +^cyan;20^reset;% Shadow, Ice, +^cyan;15^reset;% Poison, +^cyan;10^reset;% Radioactive
  ^cyan;Immune^reset;: Oxygen, Darkness, Shadow Taint
